1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,041
What's in this box it's so heavy.
这个箱子里是什么？这么重。

2
00:00:03,041 --> 00:00:11,121
I ordered some kettlebells kettlebells what for I've decided to start working out.
我订了一些壶铃。壶铃？做什么用？我决定开始锻炼。

3
00:00:11,121 --> 00:00:15,160
You I never imagined you being a fitness enthusiast.
你？我从来没想过你会成为健身爱好者。

4
00:00:15,441 --> 00:00:20,711
I'm not but I realized the other day that I'm incredibly out of shape.
我还不算，但前几天我意识到自己的体能实在很差。

5
00:00:20,721 --> 00:00:26,321
I was running to catch the bus and I was so out of breath I didn't even run that far.
我跑着追公交车，结果气喘吁吁，其实都没跑多远。

6
00:00:26,321 --> 00:00:32,071
I think my lifestyle has got more and more sedentary plus I'm getting a bit flabby.
我觉得自己的生活方式越来越久坐不动了，而且身体也有点松垮。

7
00:00:32,081 --> 00:00:36,071
Well good for you so what's your workout routine going to be.
那挺好的。你准备采用什么锻炼安排？

8
00:00:36,081 --> 00:00:43,600
I'm not sure I want to do a little bit of weight training and maybe some running and just get a bit fitter generally.
我还不确定。我想做一点力量训练，也许跑跑步，整体上变得更有体能。

9
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:49,001
It's difficult at the moment though I tried to run 1 k yesterday and I just couldn't.
不过现在挺难的。我昨天想跑一公里，就是没能做到。

10
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:56,520
Don't give up doing anything is better than doing nothing if you keep trying it'll get easier you think.
别放弃。做一点总比什么都不做好。如果继续尝试，会慢慢容易些。你觉得会吗？

11
00:00:56,801 --> 00:01:06,161
Sure when I started running it was really difficult but after a month I could do 5 k not fast but still I could do it.
当然。我刚开始跑步时也很难，但一个月后能跑五公里，虽然不快，可还是跑完了。

12
00:01:06,161 --> 00:01:14,040
Oh 5 k that seems impossible right now I guess it's something to aim for though go for it.
五公里？我现在觉得不可能，不过也算一个可以努力争取的目标。加油去做吧。

13
00:01:14,800 --> 00:01:20,401
In the dialogue you heard some words relating to fitness and exercise.
刚才的对话里，你听到了一些与体能和锻炼有关的词。

14
00:01:20,401 --> 00:01:27,671
We have a challenge for you look at definitions of three words.
现在给你一个挑战：看三个词的定义。

15
00:01:27,681 --> 00:01:39,511
Can you remember the words and phrases which match these definitions if you want you can go back and review the dialogue and try to find them.
你能记起符合这些定义的词和短语吗？如果愿意，可以返回去复习对话，试着找出它们。

16
00:01:39,521 --> 00:01:53,591
Here are the answers workout can include many different types of exercise but is mostly used for focus training for example using weights or doing aerobics.
下面是答案。workout 可以包括很多种锻炼，但主要用于有针对性的训练，例如举重或做有氧操。

17
00:01:53,601 --> 00:01:59,481
Generally when you use the verb work out you mean that you follow a routine of different exercises.
一般来说，当你用动词 work out 时，指的是遵循由不同动作组成的训练安排。

18
00:02:01,921 --> 00:02:10,070
Nowadays many of us have sedentary lifestyles sedentary is in the same word family as the verb sit.
如今很多人过着久坐的生活；sedentary 与动词 sit 属于同一词族。

19
00:02:10,080 --> 00:02:16,471
If you're sedentary you spend most of your time sitting down.
如果你是 sedentary，就表示你大部分时间都坐着。

20
00:02:16,481 --> 00:02:24,561
If someone doesn't do much exercise you can describe them as unfit out of shape or in bad shape.
如果某人不怎么运动，你可以把其体能描述为 unfit、out of shape 或 in bad shape。

21
00:02:24,561 --> 00:02:32,871
Be careful you can use these words to describe yourself but they could be rude if you use them to describe someone else.
但要注意：这些词可以用来形容自己，用来形容别人可能不礼貌。

22
00:02:32,881 --> 00:02:41,751
All these words have direct opposites unfit fit out of shape in shape in bad shape in good shape.
这些词都有直接的反义表达：unfit 对 fit，out of shape 对 in shape，in bad shape 对 in good shape。

23
00:02:41,761 --> 00:02:46,481
What about you do you work out what do you do.
那么你呢？你锻炼吗？会做什么运动？

24
00:02:46,481 --> 00:02:50,121
What can you do to avoid being sedentary if you have an office job.
如果你坐办公室，可以做些什么来避免一直坐着？

25
00:02:50,801 --> 00:02:55,111
What's the best exercise for someone who's out of shape.
对于体能不好的人，什么运动最好？

26
00:02:55,121 --> 00:03:02,231
Think about how to answer these questions pause the video and try to answer them out loud.
想想如何回答这些问题。暂停视频，试着大声回答。
